From abda5f76bd3d9e1fddcac0cf599e0f86ec43f5b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:22:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(app): sinumerik_810m_post names its Gate map

The suite came with PR #3317 and had no Gate map line. The xtask test
no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app failed with
"suites without a Gate map: [sinumerik_810m_post]".

Fixes #3719

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs b/crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs
index 1873230d4..667329258 100644
--- a/crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs
+++ b/crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs
@@ -1,5 +1,9 @@
 //! App-side registration, EMCO VMC-200 gate checks, and air-cut kit tests
 //! for Siemens Sinumerik 810M (`issue #2888`).
+//!
+//! Gate map (#2888): covers camcraft_post::post (sinumerik-810m.cps), app::posting
+//! (BUILTINS, MACHINES, post_serves, post_offer, post_setup), app::project (save),
+//! app::commands (LoadMachine, SelectPost, CreateOperation, GenerateOperation).
 
 use camcraft_app::commands::{
     AddTool, CreateOperation, GenerateOperation, History, LoadMachine, SelectPost, SetStock,
